{"id":"steam-709460","steam":709460,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Moonsteader","summary":"Start a new life on a distant moon in this cosy sci-fi Western. Grow crops, mine resources, craft equipment, repair machinery and transform a rundown homestead into a thriving settlement. Meet the locals, lend a hand and become part of a frontier community.","about":"Moonsteader is a cosy survival-lite game about starting from nothing and slowly building a settlement you're proud to call home.\n\nSettle on a moon on the edge of the galaxy. Gather resources, pan for valuable minerals, mine, recycle scrap, and craft the tools you need to survive and thrive. Expand your own homestead with new buildings, upgrade your equipment, and create a frontier that's uniquely yours.\n\nPlant different crops, keep them watered, deal with weeds and harvest your produce. Sell what you grow and use the money to improve your life on the frontier.\n\nMine, sift, salvage and explore for the raw materials you need. Different resources require different ways of gathering them.\n\nTurn what you collect into something useful. Sort raw resources, recycle scrap and fabricate the materials, tools and equipment you need.\n\nYour machinery won't look after itself. Maintain and repair equipment, replace damaged components and keep the technology your settlement depends on operational.\n\nYou're not alone on Arsian-P. Visit town, meet other settlers, help with jobs and improve the businesses and lives of the people trying to make a home on the frontier.\n\nHead beyond your settlement to discover new places, resources and opportunities across the moon. Most days are peaceful, although the frontier isn't completely without danger.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709460/d5c98bdfb394e88446cda779f2aab10db1263c74/library_capsule.jpg?t=1792340199","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709460/8ed6cf97a3f839ca8a86da327ad3aab